    },
    {
      "text": "If it is the opposite gender of the user, the target\nbecomes infatuated and less likely to attack.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "♂なら♀を　♀なら♂を　誘惑して\nメロメロに　する。\n相手は　技が　だしにくくなる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "♂诱惑♀或♀诱惑♂，\n让对手着迷。\n对手将很难使出招式。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Si el objetivo es del sexo opuesto, se enamorará y\nbajará la posibilidad de que ataque.",
